         "description": {
          "__typename": "TextValue",
          "text": "Discover breathtaking landscapes, rich history, and hidden gems with us.\n\nWe handle everything, starting with pick-up and drop off at your accommodation (private tour options only).\n\nBegin with a stop in Cascais, a charming fishing village once favored by royalty.\n\nExplore stunning, lesser-known viewpoints and choose one monument to visit inside. \n\nFeel the thrill at Cabo da Roca, mainland Europe’s westernmost point, where cliffs meet the Atlantic in postcard perfection.\n\nA municipal fee of €3.77 per person may apply for access to Sintra.\n\n*Our Tour Options:*\n\n• Private Tour Option – Without tickets included – If you choose Pena Palace or Quinta da Regaleira, purchase the tickets for 10:00am. \n• Private Tour Option – With Pena Palace ticket included – We take care of it all!\n• Group Tour Option – With Pena Palace ticket included. Meeting point/end location: Praça dos Restauradores 16, Lisbon. (This option does not offer pick up/drop off at the accommodation)"
         },
