         "description": {
          "__typename": "TextValue",
          "text": "This tour will be a day trip where travelers can enjoy the different faces of Sintra with a private certified guide and a private air-conditioned van. Travelers will visit the Pena National Palace and Quinta da Regaleira, both UNESCO World Heritage sites, as well as Monserrate Palace, National Palace the Moorish Castle and Cabo da Roca, the most western point of continental Europe. Since this tour is 100% customizable travelers can decide which monuments to visit in the inside or can decide to visit monuments only from the outside, just let us know! During the tour you will discover the hidden treasures only locals know of and will have the opportunity to try the fantastic Portuguese cuisine. The itinerary is designed in a way travelers will always avoid crowds.\n\n◉ Guided tour inside the monuments you choose to visit\n◉ Private customizable experience\n◉ Guaranteed to skip lines with our guides\n◉ We pick up and drop-off at your hotel in Lisbon, Cascais or Sintra"
